    },
    "ThermoTune can't change fan speeds until its helper tool is updated. Open ThermoTune to update it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "ThermoTune kann die Lüftergeschwindigkeit erst wieder ändern, wenn das Hilfsprogramm aktualisiert ist. Öffne ThermoTune, um es zu aktualisieren."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ThermoTune is free and open source. Bug reports, pull requests and reports of which Macs it works on are all welcome." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
